 ch group (Berlin\; EUR 3\,000 to 5\,000/month\, deadline 30 Nov 2026)
DESCRIPTION:Short guest fellowships embedded in Weizenbaum Institute resear
 ch groups working on platforms\, digital society\, AI and technology. ELIG
 IBILITY: researchers from doctoral candidates upward\; artists are not men
 tioned.\n\nOrganisation: Weizenbaum Institute for the Networked Society\nL
 ocation: Berlin\, Germany. In person.\nAward: Monthly allowance of EUR 3\,
 000 (doctoral)\, EUR 4\,000 (postdoc incl. assistant/associate professors)
  or EUR 5\,000 (professors)\; EUR 2\,500 / 3\,500 if salary continues. Plu
 s EUR 500/month child allowance and a travel lump sum of EUR 200 (Germany)
 \, 500 (Europe) or 1\,200 (outside Europe). No application fee.\nDuration:
  1 to 3 months\n\nMore: https://www.weizenbaum-institut.de/en/institute/wo
 rk-and-career/fellowships/translate-to-english-fellowship-bei-einer-forsch
 ungsgruppe/-einheit/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=refe
 rral
