DTSTART:20270101T123000Z
DTEND:20270101T130000Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 14:00 CET: Danish Arts Foundation (Statens Kunstfond): Pro
 duction and Exhibitions\, visual arts (1 January 2027 round)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 01 Jan 2027 at 14:00 CET.\n\nThe Danish Arts Foundation 
 funds producing\, showing and promoting contemporary visual art in Denmark
  and abroad. Eligible costs include new work tied to an exhibition agreeme
 nt\, the artist's own exhibition costs\, related print or digital promotio
 n\, and production and exhibition honoraria for the artist's time.\n\nOrga
 nisation: Danish Arts Foundation (Statens Kunstfond)\nLocation: Denmark or
  abroad. In practice for Danish artists\; Danish venues may apply for Dani
 sh or international artists\, non-Danish venues only for Danish artists.\n
 Award: No maximum stated\; the committee may award less than requested. Co
 vers production of new work\, exhibition costs\, promotion\, and productio
 n and exhibition honoraria for the artist. No application fee.\nDuration: 
 Set by each project\; the exhibition cannot open before the deadline\n\nMo
 re: https://www.kunst.dk/english/funding-programmes/exhibition-of-danish-a
 rt-abroad?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.kunst.dk/english/funding-programmes/exhibition-of-danish-ar
 t-abroad?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Denmark or abroad. In practice for Danish artists\; Danish venues 
 may apply for Danish or international artists\, non-Danish venues only for
  Danish artists.
END:VEVENT
