UID:oca-international-support-feb-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261110T175140Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART:20270203T222900Z
DTEND:20270203T225900Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: OCA International Support\, February 2027 round
  (travel and production support for Norway-based artists abroad)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 03 Feb 2027 at 23:59 CET.\n\nOCA administers Norwegian s
 tate funds that help Norway-based art practitioners present work abroad. T
 ravel support covers travel costs\; production support covers making work 
 for an international exhibition or project. There are three rounds a year 
 (3 February\, 3 May\, 3 October)\; the February 2027 window opens 3 Januar
 y.\n\nOrganisation: Office for Contemporary Art Norway (OCA)\nLocation: Pr
 ojects outside Norway. For Norwegian or Norway-based artists\, curators an
 d art professionals\, or the foreign hosts inviting them.\nAward: Travel s
 upport and production support\; the 2026 budgets were NOK 2\,300\,000 (tra
 vel) and NOK 3\,200\,000 (production) across three rounds. No per-grant fi
 gure published. No application fee.\nDuration: Set by each project\n\nMore
 : https://oca.no/grants-residencies/international-support?utm_source=artif
 icialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://oca.no/grants-residencies/international-support?utm_source=arti
 ficialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Projects outside Norway. For Norwegian or Norway-based artists\, c
 urators and art professionals\, or the foreign hosts inviting them.
END:VEVENT
