SUMMARY:Deadline 12:00 GMT: Cultural Bridge 2027-28\, Round 6: UK-Germany p
 artnerships in social and community arts (up to GBP 30\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 10 Feb 2027 at 12:00 GMT.\n\nCultural Bridge funds partn
 erships between UK and German arts organisations working in social and com
 munity arts practice. Round 6 is limited to established (Tier 2) partnersh
 ips with a track record of working together. Each can receive up to GBP 30
 \,000 plus access costs\, with about 12 awards expected from a GBP 360\,00
 0 pot.\n\nOrganisation: Cultural Bridge (British Council\, Goethe-Institut
 \, Fonds Soziokultur and the four UK arts councils)\nLocation: UK and Germ
 any. Partnerships between a UK-based and a Germany-based arts organisation
 .\nAward: Up to GBP 30\,000 per partnership plus access costs\, from a GBP
  360\,000 pot (about 12 awards). No application fee.\nDuration: 1 June 202
 7 to 31 July 2028\n\nMore: https://www.cultural-bridge.info/funding/?utm_s
 ource=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.cultural-bridge.info/funding/?utm_source=artificialnouveaug
 rantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:UK and Germany. Partnerships between a UK-based and a Germany-base
 d arts organisation.
