DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
SUMMARY:Deadline: Netherland-America Foundation: Cultural Grant Program (1 
 November 2026 Cut-Off)
DESCRIPTION:The Netherland-America Foundation funds professional artistic a
 nd cultural projects that show a clear exchange between Dutch and American
  artists\, institutions or audiences\, such as exhibitions\, performances 
 and other cultural initiatives that promote dialogue and collaboration. Bo
 th emerging artists and established organisations may apply.\n\nOrganisati
 on: The Netherland-America Foundation (NAF)\nLocation: Netherlands and Uni
 ted States. For professional artists and cultural organisations running pr
 ojects with a clear Dutch-American exchange.\nAward: Typically up to USD 5
 \,000 per project\, depending on scope and impact\; higher amounts possibl
 e depending on available budget. No application fee.\n\nMore: https://then
